The launcher build is derived from the KOL/KUAL Booklet launch mechanism:

- KOL Booklet: https://github.com/yparitcher/KUAL_Booklet
- KUAL Booklet: https://github.com/coplate/KUAL_Booklet
- Original KindleLauncher: https://github.com/yifanlu/KindleLauncher

The build process consumes an official KOL Booklet binary (provided by the user
for local builds, or downloaded at a pinned URL and checksum in GitHub Actions)
and patches only string constants needed for WeRead branding and an isolated
MIME registration. No Amazon firmware libraries are distributed by this
project.

The generated launcher remains subject to the applicable upstream terms and
this repository's AGPL-3.0 license.
